{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2024-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1727740800, "end_date": 1728345599, "month_true_total": 224, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:53:50 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "176584514", "author": {"steamid": "76561198122852034", "personaname": "Shin Jelly", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/insomoriac/", "num_games_owned": 158, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 5448, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 23, "playtime_at_review": 392, "last_played": 1790012937, "avatar": "bd162d28bca4a827f0ef7dc55954cea2068f1eac"}, "language": "english", "review": "Played like 200 hours of this on Xbox. The rogue-like mechanics are stellar, but the real shout out for me is the shooting. I've played multi-million dollar projects with worse shooting than this shoe-string budget rogue-like from an unknown Chinese studio. Would recommend to anyone who likes anything like Dead Cells or Hades, and also Borderlands and it's various copycats. 7.9 out of 10, with the caveat that the game needs polish on it's balance and animations.", "timestamp_created": 1728330478, "timestamp_updated": 1728330478, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176554300", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025338528", "personaname": "[HOH]Hellion666", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/hellion1969/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 53305, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 46297, "last_played": 1761213081, "avatar": "32f422cd083d6ebbb21be3a58f4c7abd8357b5b3"}, "language": "english", "review": "The new close quarters combat is rather crap. As a veteran of this game for numerous years that has just returned recently, it's disappointing that there is now a lack of bonus stages, a huge increase in boss stages and an overall different feel to the game. I'll keep on playing but it really is disappointing that they've gone down this route. One kill headshots on Reincarnation mode isn't cool when you have all the right tools......", "timestamp_created": 1728296011, "timestamp_updated": 1728296011, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176546494", "author": {"steamid": "76561198131609547", "personaname": "Rii", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198131609547/", "num_games_owned": 213, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 19117, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13937, "last_played": 1787786118, "avatar": "4fb9856acd3b90a3c6a2fa8f47627bb04b92212a"}, "language": "english", "review": ":D", "timestamp_created": 1728282469, "timestamp_updated": 1728282469, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "176534064", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071798201", "personaname": "Ellezure's Left Thigh", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198071798201/", "num_games_owned": 207, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 7343, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6521, "last_played": 1774057071, "avatar": "54e85bf62f1eb7a4c1312c6c61632ff9a6432f2b"}, "lang